<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Communications cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded 360 Communications Co to hold from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- 360 Communications lost 5/8 to 16-3/4.</p>
